 "stimulus_html": "Determine the percent discount based on the given original and sale prices.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516640,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Original price = $250.00; sale price = $162.50",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "35%"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>sale price = original price – discount</p>\n<p>162.50 = 250 – discount</p>\n<p>discount = 87.50</p>\n<p>87.50 is what percent of 250?</p>\n<p>87.50 = percent discount × 250</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{87.50}}{{250}} = \\frac{{{\\rm{percent\\ discount}} \\times \\cancel{{250}}}}{{\\cancel{{250}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.35 = {\\rm{percent\\ discount}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The percent discount is 35%.</p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516641,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Original price = $19.50; sale price = $17.16",
   "answers": [],
