     "content_html": "12%"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>sale price = original price – discount</p>\n<p>17.16 = 19.50 – discount</p>\n<p>discount = 2.34</p>\n<p>2.34 is what percent of 19.50?</p>\n<p>2.34 = percent discount × 19.50</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{2.34}}{{19.50}} = \\frac{{{\\rm{percent\\ discount}} \\times \\cancel{{19.50}}}}{{\\cancel{{19.50}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.12 = {\\rm{percent\\ discount}}\"></span></p>\n<p>The percent discount is 12%.</p>"
    }
   ],
